    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, I know that was quite a race when you ran. I enjoyed watching that. I was familiar with you a little bit before, but then when you ran for Congress, I was a lot more familiar with you. You've got a great story and a great history and background. Why did you decide to leave a safe space that you have right now in Congress? It's safe for you. There's no doubt about that in my mind. Run for Secretary of State.",
