  {
    "episode_id": 70674,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, it is the 10th District of Georgia is a very safe district, very red. We've got a great relationship with the people in 10th District. And yeah, we could stay there for as long as we wanted to quite frankly. But this issue of election integrity, Rick, it's become the number one issue on the minds of people in Georgia in many ways across the country. And what happened in our last election here in Georgia was an absolute disaster. As a member of Congress, I'm also for eight years now. I've been a member of the oversight committee. About two years ago, the Democrats started pushing for the passage of HR1, a",
