    "turn_text": "I know there are very few people that are actually on my bucket list before I pass this life through to meet and talk to and shake their hand and one of them is Donald Trump. That's one thing that one of these days it'll happen one way or the other but at least I pray it will. He's done his thing. It was a tight race the last time he ran. So what is it that you would do differently than what Brad has done moving forward? What would you do differently than what he's doing?",
