    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "Well, the way that the harvesting went and everything was just crazy. And the bottom line is now that they did it that way, and it works so well, they want to put it in place as a permanent way of doing it. It's the way we're supposed to do things and you go back to normal or whatever we used to do and they go crazy. It's all of a sudden a racist thing. The word that I think is lost so much meaning in our vocabulary today. but that's what they use that it is it's we're trying to do something to negate votes by just going back to what the pre the pre-covid way of doing it was and",
