  {
    "episode_id": 70674,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's crazy. And just mailing out, like you said, mailing out all of the absentee voters. I can remember the day back when we did only, you had to have a reason to absentee, to vote absentee, and it had, there were only a couple of reasons. But if bottom line, if you could vote in person, and you were going to be at home and you were going to be where you could, then you voted in person. That's",
