  {
    "episode_id": 70674,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "And that's the only way we're going to get back to voter integrity is we get back to the majority of the people, like it or not, get off their rear ends, go to a polling place. People used to consider it an honor to be seen in the voting line. And now it's amazing how many shadow voters there are.",
