    "turn_text": "Well it's so important and for those that don't know or wondering this SB 202 is the bill that everybody was raising so much hell about on the Democrat side that it was going to restrict people and cut down on and be against black and minority votes and it was cutting back when actually and I mean even with the advanced voting. We have more advanced voting right now than they do up in some of the, like Delaware, some of the states up there. So they complain about all this, but we have far more open voting than most any of the Democrat states up in the Northeast.",
