      },
      {
        "text": "People are tired of political theater.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "People want to address the truth when there are problems.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Voting is more accessible in Georgia than in Colorado.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
