        "text": "Truth is achievable and worth pursuing in public discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures should prioritize factual accuracy over partisan narratives.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members value honesty and problem-solving over performative politics.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Accusations in political contexts are typically motivated by strategic manipulation rather than genuine concern.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has sufficient credibility to critique political behavior without being seen as biased.",
