    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. And, you know, I think, at the end of the day, I think it's important that we recognize when it comes to elections. It's really not about who wins an election. It's all about was it a fair election, though?",
