        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership must actively pursue legal action against those who break election laws.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "A loss in a fair election should be accepted even if personally upsetting.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
