  {
    "episode_id": 70674,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "Well the government is basically supposed to is there for really the protection of the nation and that's the primary goal. And it has failed in every single way. It can possibly fail. And it's not this race, but the border is driving nuts. But, you know, that's on your congressional end of it, just so you know. That drives me crazy. It drives so many others crazy. But, well, what will you do as Secretary of State to ensure that these elections are secure?",
