        "confidence": 0.98
      },
      {
        "text": "The Secretary of State has two primary responsibilities: overseeing elections and managing business licensing and permitting.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The Secretary of State possesses robust investigative authority over election-related misconduct.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Allegations of mismanagement or fraud in elections must be investigated when raised.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "SB 202 represents significant progress in election reform.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The legal challenge against federal election interference will succeed in court due to constitutional clarity.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "When wrongdoing is found, there should be consequences.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Fulton County has been guilty of decades of wrongdoing related to elections.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A proper Secretary of State must oppose the Biden Department of Justice’s involvement in Georgia's elections.",
