    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70674.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 54,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. And listen, there's more investigative power, if you will, on the election side. That robust capacity needs to be on the business side as well. Because if your business is not able to renew its license in a timely manner, you end up operating technically",
